  "prefLabel": "Mec 102.22 Registration agency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 102.22 “Registration agency” means the U.S. Department of Labor’s Office of Apprenticeship or a recognized state apprenticeship agency that has responsibility for reviews for compliance with 29 CFR, Part 29 and 30, and conducting quality assurance assessments.\n\nSource. #13483, eff 1-9-23; #14408, eff 10-17-25",
